(
    title: "Fathom",
    developer: Some("Rob Fulop"),
    description: Some("The player is Proteus, a shape-shifter who dives as a dolphin — collecting seahorses while dodging octopuses and seaweed — then turns into a seagull to soar overhead, gathering clouds past hostile birds and erupting volcanoes. Each starfish that appears yields a shard of Neptune\'s trident; gather all three and dive to free the caged mermaid Neptina, whereupon the map widens and the hunt starts again."),
